Long context:

- No long-context retrieval (MRCR/RULER) reported for the 32K FIM/NextEdit window

Relative vendor claims (not benchmark scores — recorded for traceability):

- Edits accepted **48% more often** than the predecessor; **27% more selective** in edits displayed (vendor launch post, 2026-10-29; production accept/reject A/B, no absolute acceptance rates or denominators published)
- End-to-end latency benchmarked internally against "custom next-edit models and speed-optimized frontier models" — no ms/tok-s values published

