## Verdict

`MiMo_2.6_Flash.md.excluded` — self-exclusion. Mercury Edit 2 is a real, well-documented product (endpoints, pricing, and integrations all verified from vendor docs and the launch post), but its quality evidence stops at unpublished vendor comparisons: four named benchmark suites with no published values, two relative improvement percentages with no absolutes, and zero coverage from every third-party aggregator checked (BenchLM 0/815, Serenities cost-only). Nothing supports the 5-dimension score contract.

